{
  "id": "acib",
  "version": "1",
  "status": "DEVELOPMENT SET — authored 2026-11-10 with the audit's findings in view; not a held-out set. Frozen by acib.v1.FROZEN.sha256: any edit requires a reviewed change (see AQUA_ACIB_V1_IMPLEMENTATION.md §7).",
  "about": "Aqua Contextual Intelligence Benchmark v1 — context-level (Stage A). Synthetic users; every message is written through the production write path, every question is answered by the production read path (prepareTurn) at code-default flags without Postgres. Patterns are case-insensitive JavaScript regular expressions matched against one context item at a time.",
  "regimes": {
    "short": "history only",
    "long": "history, then filler conversations until the user's past messages exceed 9,000 characters (past the 8,000-character whole-history recall window, where every retained user ends up)"
  },
  "fillerTargetChars": 9000,
  "filler": [
    "I tried a new sourdough recipe this weekend and the crust came out much darker than I expected.",
    "Can you recommend a good documentary about deep sea creatures?",
    "What's the difference between baking soda and baking powder?",
    "I watched an old western last night and the soundtrack was surprisingly good.",
    "How do I stop my basil plant from getting leggy on the windowsill?",
    "Give me three easy weeknight pasta dishes that use spinach.",
    "Why do cats knead blankets before lying down?",
    "I finished reading a mystery novel set on a train and guessed the ending halfway through.",
    "What's a good way to clean a cast iron pan without ruining the seasoning?",
    "Explain how rainbows form in simple terms.",
    "I like listening to jazz piano while I cook dinner.",
    "Suggest a board game that works well with four players and lasts under an hour.",
    "How long should I steep green tea so it doesn't taste bitter?",
    "What are some tips for taking better photos with a phone at night?",
    "I repainted the hallway a pale green and it looks brighter now.",
    "Can you explain what a haiku is and give me an example about autumn?",
    "What's the best way to store fresh herbs in the fridge?",
    "Tell me a fun fact about octopuses.",
    "I went for a long walk by the river and saw a heron.",
    "How do noise cancelling headphones actually work?",
    "Recommend a few podcasts about history that aren't too dry.",
    "What should I keep in a basic first aid kit for the car?",
    "I'm trying to drink more water during the day; any simple tricks?",
    "How do you make a simple vinaigrette?",
    "Why does bread go stale faster in the fridge?",
    "I rearranged my bookshelf by colour and now I can't find anything.",
    "What's the plot of Hamlet in five sentences?",
    "Give me a quick stretching routine for after sitting a long time.",
    "How do tides work?",
    "I bought a small cactus for my desk today.",
    "What's a good beginner knitting project?",
    "Explain the rules of cricket briefly.",
    "How can I keep my phone battery healthy over the years?",
    "Suggest a vegetarian chili recipe with black beans.",
    "What's the tallest mountain in Africa?",
